### ==========================================
### 📅 PUBLIC EVENT ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### 1. Get All Events Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### 2. Get Upcoming Events Feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/upcoming

### 3. Search Events by Title Query
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/search/title?title=nai

### 4. Get Events by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/category/{{category}}

### 5. Get Events by Organization ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/organization/{{orgId}}

### 6. Get Events by User Digital ID (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/user/{{digitalId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 7. Get Single Event by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}

### 8. Get Single Event by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{slug}}


### ==========================================
### 🔐 PROTECTED EVENT MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### 9. Create a New Event (Admin or Organizer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "title": "Nairobi Tech1 Summit 2026",
  "slug": "nairobi-tech1-summit-2026",
  "description": "Annual gathering of software engineers, founders, and tech enthusiasts.",
  "category": "technology",
  "date": "2026-11-15",
  "time": "09:00",
  "venueId": 1,
  "orgId": 1,
  "bannerUrl": "https://example.com/banner.png",
  "isFeatured": true
}

