### 10. Update Event Details (Admin or Organizer)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "title": "Nairobi Tech Summit 2026 (Updated)",
  "description": "Expanded venue and track sessions added."
}

### 11. Update Event Status (Admin or Organizer)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 12. Delete an Event (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}


### ==========================================
### 🎫 BOOKING & TICKET ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### 13. Get All Bookings (Admin or Organizer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 14. Get Recent Bookings Feed (Admin or Organizer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/recent
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 15. Get Bookings by User Digital ID (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/user/{{digitalId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 16. Get Bookings by Event ID (Admin or Organizer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/event/{{eventId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 17. Get Event Booking Statistics & Revenue Overview (Admin or Organizer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/event/{{eventId}}/stats
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 18. Get Single Booking by ID (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}


### 1. Create Guest Booking (No Login Required / Frictionless M-Pesa / Card Checkout)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 3,
  "ticketTypeId":  49,
  "quantity": 2,
  "guestName": "Brian Gakenye",
  "guestEmail": "gakenye@example.com",
  "guestPhone": "254112310754",
  "idempotencyKey": "unique-bookingS-key-002"
}

### 2. Create User Booking (Logged-in with Digital ID session)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "eventId": 3,
  "ticketTypeId": 49,
  "quantity": 1,
  "digitalId": 1,
  "idempotencyKey": "unique-booking-key-002"
}
### 18. Create a New Ticket Booking / Checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": 2,
  "ticketTypeName": "VIP Pass",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 2500.00,
  "digitalId": 1,
  "guestName": "Jane Doe",
  "guestEmail": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "guestPhone": "+254712345678",
  "idempotencyKey": "unique-checkout-txn-uuid-001"
}

### 19. Update Booking Status (Admin or Organizer)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/47/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "bookingStatus": "Confirmed"
}

### 20. Cancel a Booking
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Cookie: token={{token}}